@* Root component mounted by the Desktop host's BlazorWebView ("RootComponents.Add<Routes>("#app")").
   No actual client-side routing exists yet — there is exactly one surface so far (the map canvas
   plus its Phase 4 toolbar/dialogs) — so this simply composes MainLayout around MapCanvas and
   MapToolbar rather than introducing a Router/RouteView pair with nothing to route between. A
   real @page-based router arrives once the Map Library and Options panel (Phases 5-6) add
   further pages. *@
@namespace RhinoSurfaceMapper.UI.Components.Layout
@using RhinoSurfaceMapper.UI.Components.Map

<MainLayout>
    <MapCanvas />
    <MapToolbar />
</MainLayout>
